  "body": "### Summary\n`ReaderInsetsWebTests/aRefreshReopensAtTheSameMessageWhenTheBarsChanged` fails intermittently, so unrelated PRs go red.\n\n### Evidence\n- CI on #586 at `69a84194` (a docs and fixtures PR): the only failing test of `App build + tests (iOS 27 simulator)`, run 42383009104.\n- Local full app suite on #589 at `76ded38f` under heavy Mac load: 1 failure out of 1160, this test; it passes when run alone (7 runs).\n- `ReaderLandingWebTests` had a similar miss under load, also passing alone.\n\n### Scope\nFind what the test waits on (a fixed delay or a layout pass) and make it wait on the condition itself. Do not retry the test to hide it.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\nThe test passes 20 runs in a row in a loaded simulator run, and fails when the refresh does not reopen at the same message.\n",
